  "texts": {
    "preamble": "Mool Chand & Anr vs State on 9 August, 2017 Author: Chief Justice Bench: Chief Justice High Court Of Judicature For Rajasthan At Jodhpur S.B. Criminal Revision No. 516 / 1997 1. Mool Chand S/o Asu Ram, by caste Sharma, resident of Pokran House, Loco Road, Jodhpur. 2. Hanuman Prasad S/o Sri Krishna by caste Jangid, resident of Pokran House, Loco Road, Jodhpur. ----Petitioner Versus The State of Rajasthan. ----Respondent _____________________________________________________ For Petitioner(s) : Mr.Vinit Jain For Respondent(s) : Mr.J.P.Bhardwaj, Public Prosecutor.",
    "facts": "The petitioners were convicted for an offence punishable under Section 7/16 of the Prevention of Food Adulteration Act, 1954. 2. The case of the prosecution is that a sample of mustered oil was taken from Laxmi Kirana Store and Public Analyst found it to be adulterated inasmuch as it did not conform to the prescribed standards. 3. Apart from other issues, an issue of notice contemplated by Section 13(2) of the Prevention of Food Adulteration Act, 1954 being served upon the petitioners was urged.",
